# the stems (tests/host/stems_test.sh): a short film over the pages, HOME's views, a layer's page, the Arrangement
# page, with every stem and without; the film and the WAV the same, every stem the film's frames
wait 3000
wav stems.wav
film stems.film
wait 600
turn ALGO 1
wait 500
turn ALGO 1
wait 500
tap ENV
wait 500
tap SEL
key b0 down
wait 400
key b0 up
tap HOME
wait 500
filmstop
wavstop
